  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together shio-koji, Korean chili flakes, garlic, and ginger to make the cure.",
    "Add the tofu to the cure and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the bruised lemongrass to the skillet and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the marinated tofu to the skillet and cook until golden brown.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "To assemble the ssam, place a piece of tofu on a perilla leaf and top with a piece of lemongrass.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional perilla leaves and lemongrass if desired."
